+/*
+ * The models are read here, without assimp: vkmark's scenes draw only
+ * 3DS (cube, cat, horse) and PLY (kmscube) files, and its tests give OBJ
+ * strings. Each loader makes a list of triangles, three corners each in
+ * the order they are drawn, as assimp's Triangulate, SortByPType (lines and
+ * points dropped) and GenNormals steps left them:
+ *  - a polygon is a fan from its first corner;
+ *  - a 3DS mesh's corners are put back in its local space (the inverse of
+ *    its mesh matrix, with x negated where that matrix mirrors), and its
+ *    normals are the sums of the area-weighted normals of the triangles
+ *    that share a corner's position and a smoothing group, normalized;
+ *  - a PLY or OBJ model without normals has each triangle's own.
+ */
+
